    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιηχ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ring all round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιήχησεν δ᾽ ἄρα χαλκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.267
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>: c. acc. loci, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θόρυβος π. τὴν οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.720c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηγάνοισι περιηχούμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					140
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος περιηχουμένη τῷ κύματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be noised abroad, to be celebrated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.Bybl.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιηχήθησάν τινα κατέχειν δημόσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cod.Just.</u>
					10.11.8
				</span></i>
			
			<u>Intr.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
