				36.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ή, ἡ</span>, <i>noise all around</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
			</span></i> Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.249S.
			</span></i></div>
